      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Spandex is a lightweight, synthetic fabric known for its high elasticity. It refers to polyether-polyurea copolymer fabrics crafted through various processes. This material is also known as elastane in some countries. Spandex is a synthetic fiber that has revolutionized the world of fashion and activewear with its unique combination of stretch, comfort, and durability. It is used in a wide range of products, from athletic wear and swimwear to jeans and lingerie.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "氨纶是一种轻质的合成面料，以其高弹性而闻名。它指的是通过各种过程制作的聚醚-聚脲共聚物面料。在一些国家，这种材料也被称为弹性纤维。氨纶是一种合成纤维，以其独特的伸缩性、舒适性和耐用性革新了时尚和运动服装的世界。它被用于各种产品中，从运动服装和泳装到牛仔裤和内衣。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
